{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867230/extras/6894aef7b43b9af91a64f2115359b90c.avif?t=1769376844\" width=616 height=72 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world plagued by the Demon Lord\u2019s shadow, your village is destroyed, and your little sister is cursed. Fueled by a desire to rebuild what was lost and protect those you care about, you embark on a journey with your childhood friends and a determined guild leader. Together, you\u2019ll face dangerous foes, forge deep bonds, and uncover the truth behind the darkness threatening your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867230/extras/aed1549d798371e008e8d7b17cc1ed86.avif?t=1769376844\" width=616 height=72 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance thrilling adventures with heartfelt moments as you battle monsters, explore dungeons, and grow closer to six unique heroines. Your choices shape the story, deepening relationships and unlocking romantic paths. Experience a vibrant fantasy world brought to life with stunning hand-drawn monochrome art and a blend of adventure and dating sim mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867230/extras/368045d161048e337e0740a5a2b59a0e.avif?t=1769376844\" width=616 height=72 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867230/extras/2d2ec21f17b7f9900156a54042d8f030.avif?t=1769376844\" width=616 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867230/extras/cc2b233340fc4be81302b3c5b770786f.avif?t=1769376844\" width=616 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867230/extras/a4d131525ef53ae6db8c38cad92d0dc1.avif?t=1769376844\" width=616 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867230/extras/0081c2c22a55d59af41dbea95419b913.avif?t=1769376844\" width=616 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867230/extras/75b6a949c9207a3572d4a2a9435d87ff.avif?t=1769376844\" width=616 height=274 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867230/extras/d94e48ef8d503265bc49cb0425b87566.avif?t=1769376844\" width=616 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867230/extras/9e4ba57f4957ae16d1731f1ef1f18ce7.avif?t=1769376844\" width=616 height=72 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Deep &amp; Dynamic Character Interactions</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has their own unique story and dreams. Spend time with them, build relationships, and uncover their hidden pasts. Your choices shape their journey\u2014and yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Challenging Yet Immersive Combat</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield isn\u2019t fair, and neither is life! As the protagonist, you start off weak, relying on your powerful allies to survive. But as the story unfolds, you\u2019ll gradually grow stronger\u2014until the day you surpass even your mightiest companions. Experience a turn-based combat system that evolves alongside your character\u2019s journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>A Story-Driven Experience with Secrets to Uncover</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is filled with deep lore, unexpected twists, and hidden secrets waiting to be revealed. Will you uncover the truth behind the world and your companions? Every choice you make could lead to a new discovery.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867230?t=1769376844","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867230?t=1769376844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867230/6c35d5beaf3c2776d31437cbc5a23e3728821d31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769376844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867230/6c35d5beaf3c2776d31437cbc5a23e3728821d31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769376844","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867230/extras/6894aef7b43b9af91a64f2115359b90c.avif?t=1769376844\" width=616 height=72 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world plagued by the Demon Lord\u2019s shadow, your village is destroyed, and your little sister is cursed. Fueled by a desire to rebuild what was lost and protect those you care about, you embark on a journey with your childhood friends and a determined guild leader. Together, you\u2019ll face dangerous foes, forge deep bonds, and uncover the truth behind the darkness threatening your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/